cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper (preferred-citation) and this software."
title: "yuhan-mfdas"
abstract: >-
  Matched-filter (template-matching) earthquake detection and cataloguing
  pipeline for seafloor Distributed Acoustic Sensing (DAS) strain-rate data
  accompanying the paper "Persistent Faulting Activity Along the Kefalonia
  Transform Fault Revealed by Seafloor DAS". This repository corresponds to the
  yuhan_dasmf_v1.0 folder of the Zenodo archive v1.0.0 (matched_filter_release.zip)
  with portability and metadata fixes; the data are in the Zenodo archive.
